# Private notes for your own values. Wrangler does not read this file.
# Local dev reads engine/.dev.vars (see .dev.vars.example); production secrets
# are uploaded once with:
#   npx wrangler secret put OPENSOURCEBOOK_CLIENT_TOKEN
#   npx wrangler secret put GEMINI_API_KEY        # and/or DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put YTDLP_SIDECAR_URL     # optional
#   npx wrangler secret put YTDLP_SIDECAR_TOKEN   # optional
#   npx wrangler secret put JINA_API_KEY          # optional
#
# iOS app values (not secrets for the provider, but keep them out of git):
# IOS_ENGINE_BASE_URL=https://your-worker.your-account.workers.dev
# IOS_ENGINE_CLIENT_TOKEN=
